.Torsion.MassIdentity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassIdentity.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassIdentity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassIdentity","kind":"structure","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassIdentity.lean#L51-L66","doc":"**Mass Identity** (generic core): `m = ‖MI∫_Σ (∇_A q, L ∧ F⁺)‖`.\n\nThe vortex cycle together with the two multiplicative-integration factors,\nover an arbitrary base ring.  The archimedean realisation is\n`QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity`.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:mass-identity}` ","signatureChunk":0}]}